# NUTCADE "Trust & help" translations: the check of your 12 words, update notices, Help & FAQ (with the Privacy answer), mint details,
# Hide amounts. Each row: English, Spanish, Portuguese (Brazil), German, French (German uses "Du", French "vous").
# {#} stands for a number (the version in "v1.15.0"), kept as written. The English must match the text in src/app_trust.js exactly.
# Run: python3 tools/i18n_trust.py  ->  writes src/i18n_trust.js, which adds these to the dictionaries in i18n.js.
# A key that i18n.js, i18n_r4.js or i18n_daily.js already has is left as it is.
